  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 871a59ef81fc4408f9f098fcacfc07ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: Three torn attempts at one sentence
  body: 'Kept, not burnt:


    ''He did not do it.''


    ''I have looked at this
    every way and Jonas Reed did not ''


    ''It was not him. It was never him.''


    You
    have already read the sentence she finally kept. You found it sixty-one years
    from now, in a sea chest, out of order.


    [placeholder - her drafts are Simon''s
    to write]'
  setsFlag: 
