  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: The ledger, open on the desk
  body: 'November 1698. One page has been cut out close to the binding - the stub
    is still in it.


    The ruling on the stub matches the manifest bound into
    the deed book, the one you have been carrying knowledge of since 1922.


    A
    man does not take a knife to his own accounts for a small reason.


    [placeholder]'
  setsFlag: 
