    record, the insurance entries. It holds.


    The stereo card she made - the
    one with 1861 on the mount - I have put behind the brick with the chipped corner,
    in the old firebox, and mortared it in myself.


    Nobody will find it until
    the wall comes down.


    [placeholder text - his real notes are Simon''s to
    write]'
  setsFlag: 
