  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: A coat, folded to the bottom of the chest
  body: 'Vane''s own. Good cloth, carefully folded, and folded wrong - folded to
    hide the right cuff.


    The blood has dried black on it.


    Worn once,
    never again, never destroyed. He could not wear it and he could not burn it.
    That is the whole of this family in one garment.


    [placeholder]'
  setsFlag: 
