  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 871a59ef81fc4408f9f098fcacfc07ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: A stereo view of the house, from the water
  body: 'In her hand, on the mount:


    ''The confession is where the cold comes
    in. Look where the draught crosses the sill.''


    But the confession is not
    there anymore. You found it in the sea chest, sixty-one years from now, where
    a journalist left it.


    Somebody got here first.


    [placeholder]'
  setsFlag: 
