  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 871a59ef81fc4408f9f098fcacfc07ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: Four folded sittings, in a woman's hand
  body: 'I am Abigail Sturgis. I am thirty-one years old. I have been in this room
    since the second week of June and Dr. Wills does not any longer pretend that
    I will leave it...


    ...His name was Jonas Reed. Say it somewhere. That is
    all I ever wanted and I find at the end that it is not very much to ask.


    A.
    S.


    [abridged placeholder - the full confession is in ~/Documents/OneRoom/documents]'
  setsFlag: 
