  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 871a59ef81fc4408f9f098fcacfc07ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: The deed book of the Vane house
  body: 'The conveyance of this house. And bound into the same volume, a ship''s
    manifest.


    Goods entered that were never aboard any vessel, insured at full
    value. The ruling of the page matches a cut stub you have not found yet.


    He
    could not burn this without burning his own title. So he hid it in the wall instead.


    [placeholder]'
  setsFlag: 
