  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: A purse, under the floor
  body: 'Heavy. Full. Hidden in a hurry.


    You are carrying this same purse.
    In your bag it is a rotted flat lump with the coins fused green.


    Jonas
    hid it here and never came back for it, because in April they hanged him.


    [placeholder]'
  setsFlag: 
