  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Stereopsis.Readable
  title: A half-burnt sheet, one corner unburnt
  body: 'Still smouldering at the edge. Four words survive, in an older hand than
    Samuel''s:


    ''...paid to the mason...''


    The rest is ash. Someone pulled
    this back out of the fire, and then thought better of keeping it whole.


    [placeholder
    - and per CHAIN this page exists ONLY in 1774. It is gone from every later era.]'
  setsFlag: 
